# ============================================================================
# Repository policy (owner decision, 2026-09-03):
#   * Markdown is LOCAL-ONLY. Every *.md is ignored unless whitelisted below.
#     Adding a whitelist entry is a human decision.
#   * The planning kit (planning/), Claude Code files (.claude/) and the
#     orchestration board are never committed.
# The M0 tooling task appends build/tooling ignores BELOW this block and must
# keep this block intact.
# ============================================================================
*.md
!README.md
!CHANGELOG.md
!CONTRIBUTING.md
!SECURITY.md
!.github/**/*.md

planning/
.claude/

/vendor/
/composer.lock
# tools/php-matrix.php: per-version manifests, locks, ini files and parked vendor sets.
/.matrix/
/build/
/tools/.cache/
.phpunit.result.cache
/.phpunit.cache/
.php-cs-fixer.cache
/.phpcs-cache
/tools/php-cs-fixer/vendor/
/tools/php-cs-fixer/composer.lock
